  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "Deliver me, O LORD, from the evil man: preserve me from the violent man;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "Which imagine mischiefs in their heart; continually are they gathered together for war.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "They have sharpened their tongues like a serpent; adders’ poison is under their lips. Selah.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "Keep me, O LORD, from the hands of the wicked; preserve me from the violent man; who have purposed to overthrow my goings.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "The proud have hid a snare for me, and cords; they have spread a net by the wayside; they have set gins for me. Selah.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "I said unto the LORD, Thou art my God: hear the voice of my supplications, O LORD.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "O GOD the Lord, the strength of my salvation, thou hast covered my head in the day of battle.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "Grant not, O LORD, the desires of the wicked: further not his wicked device; lest they exalt themselves. Selah.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "As for the head of those that compass me about, let the mischief of their own lips cover them.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "Let burning coals fall upon them: let them be cast into the fire; into deep pits, that they rise not up again.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "Let not an evil speaker be established in the earth: evil shall hunt the violent man to overthrow him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "I know that the LORD will maintain the cause of the afflicted, and the right of the poor.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:140:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "Surely the righteous shall give thanks unto thy name: the upright shall dwell in thy presence.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 140:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:140:13"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
